@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #1e1e1e
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #2b2b2b
skinparam participantBorderColor #888
skinparam participantFontColor white
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #00ffff
actor User
participant "Router" as R
participant "User-test.controller" as C

'=== GET /all-tests ===
User -> R: GET /all-tests
R -> C: getAllTests()
note right of C: Không tìm thấy thân hàm getAllTests
C --> R: JSON
R --> User: HTTP GET /all-tests response

'=== GET /latest ===
User -> R: GET /latest
R -> C: getLatestTests()
note right of C: Không tìm thấy thân hàm getLatestTests
C --> R: JSON
R --> User: HTTP GET /latest response

'=== GET /recent ===
User -> R: GET /recent
R -> C: verifyAccessToken()
note right of C: Không tìm thấy thân hàm verifyAccessToken
C --> R: JSON
R --> User: HTTP GET /recent response

'=== GET / ===
User -> R: GET /
R -> C: verifyAccessToken()
note right of C: Không tìm thấy thân hàm verifyAccessToken
C --> R: JSON
R --> User: HTTP GET / response

'=== GET /:testId ===
User -> R: GET /:testId
R -> C: getTest()
note right of C: Không tìm thấy thân hàm getTest
C --> R: JSON
R --> User: HTTP GET /:testId response

'=== GET /:testId/history ===
User -> R: GET /:testId/history
R -> C: verifyAccessToken()
note right of C: Không tìm thấy thân hàm verifyAccessToken
C --> R: JSON
R --> User: HTTP GET /:testId/history response

'=== GET /:testId/detail ===
User -> R: GET /:testId/detail
R -> C: verifyAccessToken()
note right of C: Không tìm thấy thân hàm verifyAccessToken
C --> R: JSON
R --> User: HTTP GET /:testId/detail response

'=== POST /:testId/submit ===
User -> R: POST /:testId/submit
R -> C: verifyAccessToken()
note right of C: Không tìm thấy thân hàm verifyAccessToken
C --> R: JSON
R --> User: HTTP POST /:testId/submit response

@enduml
